    {
      "id": "alteryx_31",
      "text": "The input contains a series of name/value pairs within the description field. The description field has a HTML table that contains 14 name/value contained within <td> tags. Each pairing can be found on a different row (designated by the <tr> tag).\n\nThe objective is to produce a table containing the 14 name/value pairs.",
